# Sections (reference/components/document.md). Pages of 300 × 200 with margins of 20 (page area of 260 × 160 from (20, 20)).
#
# Three sections, five pages, each one with its Page:
#   cover (1 page):    Margin 0, page area of 300 × 200 from (0, 0), without numbers or the document's Page overlays.
#                      cover-box fills the page (0, 0, 300 × 200); stamp (Page overlay of the section) appears at (10, 10), 40 × 20.
#   body (2 pages):    the document's Page. b1 (20, 20) and b2 (20, 80) fit on page 2 (physical); b3 does not (60 + 60 + 60 > 160)
#                      (Keep together: true, so it is not split) and moves to page 3, at (20, 20). head (Pages: first, of the section) appears only on the first page
#                      of the section: physical page 2, at (20, 20), 260 × 12. foot (Page overlay of the document) appears on both,
#                      at the bottom: y = 20 + 160 - 12 = 168.
#   wide (2 pages):    Width 400, Height 150, Margin 10: page area of 380 × 130 from (10, 10). w1 (10, 10, 380 × 50);
#                      w2 (100, not split) does not fit below (50 + 100 > 130) and moves to page 5. foot: y = 10 + 130 - 12 = 128, 380 wide.
# The printed numbers: the cover has none; body is 1 and 2 ("Página 1 de 2"); wide restarts, 1 and 2.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Page overlay:
		Id: foot
		Offset: auto 0 0 0
		Box:
			Height: 12
			Background: #E3E8EE
		Text: Página {page} de {pages}
			Typography:
				Align: center
	Section:
		Id: cover
		Page numbering: none
		Inherit page overlays: false
		Page:
			Margin: 0
		Block:
			Id: cover-box
			Box:
				Height: 200
				Padding: 20
				Background: #1F3A5F
			Typography:
				Color: #FFFFFF
				Size: 20
			Text: Portada
		Page overlay:
			Id: stamp
			Offset: 10 auto auto 10
			Box:
				Width: 40
				Height: 20
				Background: #F2C94C
			Text: Sello
	Section:
		Id: body
		Page overlay:
			Id: head
			Pages: first
			Offset: 0 0 auto 0
			Box:
				Height: 12
				Background: #C9D6E2
			Text: Cuerpo
		Block:
			Id: b1
			Box:
				Height: 60
				Background: #DCEBDD
			Text: Uno
		Block:
			Id: b2
			Box:
				Height: 60
				Background: #EFE6CF
			Text: Dos
		Block:
			Id: b3
			Break:
				Keep together: true
			Box:
				Height: 60
				Background: #DCEBDD
			Text: Tres
	Section:
		Id: wide
		Page numbering: restart
		Page:
			Width: 400
			Height: 150
			Margin: 10
		Block:
			Id: w1
			Box:
				Height: 50
				Background: #EFE6CF
			Text: Ancha uno
		Block:
			Id: w2
			Break:
				Keep together: true
			Box:
				Height: 100
				Background: #DCEBDD
			Text: Ancha dos
